abstract: >-
  A source-preserving native ESS-MAI/AIGovern-Cyber hierarchy experiment
  with LIGHT coordination, QUANTUM reasoning and SHADOW verification and
  durable Vault writes. Five user turns produce three operational HOLDs
  and two native paired verdicts in one declared era00 model, with exact
  request replay and conflict evidence. AI Authority Entity is presented
  as an architectural paradigm proposal, not a universal security,
  exactly-once execution or external-agent interoperability guarantee.
